=== HTML ===
<h1>Hello world!</h1>

<p>
	Did you know there are over 100 elements to choose from? <strong>THAT’S SO MANY!</strong>
</p>

<p>
	You only need a handful of them to build a real website, though. Most of the
	ones I use every day are somewhere on this page.
</p>

<hr>

<p>Here are a few more, just so you can see the shape of them:</p>

<blockquote>
	A blockquote, for when you’re quoting somebody.
</blockquote>

<ul>
	<li>A list item</li>
	<li>Another list item</li>
</ul>

<button>A button that doesn’t do anything yet</button>
